<title>GERMANY: Holzmann 96 output steady at 14.1 bln dmk.</title>
<headline>Holzmann 96 output steady at 14.1 bln dmk.</headline>
<text>
<p>FRANKFURT, Feb 18 Reuter - Year to end 1996</p>
<p>(in millions of marks unless otherwise stated)</p>
<p>    Group construction output	     14,056  vs 14,094</p>
<p>    Group incoming orders		   16,486  vs 14,501</p>
<p>    Group orders in hand		    15,908  vs 13,170</p>
<p>NOTE - Full company name is Philipp Holzmann AG.</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom, +49 69 756525</p>
</text>
